{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Checked acceptance criteria before close. Decision recorded: reduce by checking durable store structure before the HEAD probe, with no cache. Post-change measurement using the same list_tickets predicate-neutralization style on this real worktree showed no positive predicate overhead (WITH predicate median 3659.0 ms; WITHOUT predicate median 4100.6 ms; delta -441.5 ms, noise dominated by whole-store reduction), and the regression test proves initialized structured stores do not spawn git. Focused tests passed: tests/unit/test_reads_uninitialized_store.py and related read-store tests. Full make verify failed only the known Copilot GIT_CONFIG_* repo-isolation artifact, confirmed by solo env-unset rerun. Caching and accepted-as-is AC branches are marked N/A because this implementation uses neither."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788837230315128001,"uuid":"e592273a-0273-4114-bdfa-da15ccb65c28"}